OL,3,GNEWSAWoman, 84, dies after being hit by
OL,4,Acar
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn 84-year-old woman has died after
OL,7,Fbeing hit by a car in East Yorkshire.
OL,9,FHumberside Police said a blue
OL,10,FVolkswagen Polo was driving along Cave
OL,11,FRoad in Ellerker, near Brough, at about
OL,12,F16:50 GMT on Monday when it hit a
OL,13,Fpedestrian at the junction of
OL,14,FBrantingham Road.
OL,16,FThe woman, who has been named as Ruth
OL,17,FHurd, was taken to hospital where she
OL,18,Fhas since died.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
