OL,3,GNEWSAWoman, 84, dies after being hit by
OL,4,Acar
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice said inquiries remain ongoing
OL,7,Finto the incident, and anyone who
OL,8,Fwitnessed it or has dashcam footage
OL,9,Ffrom around the time is urged to get in
OL,10,Ftouch.
